      "created_at": "2013-04-25T12:52:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Depending on his level of set-up going in, Argent Adept can really benefit from the \"Play a card\" simply because he has so many good cards to play. \"Silver Shadow? Don't mind if I do....\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Of course, I'm also the one who played Argent Adept as the tank and then dealt the final 7 points to the villain without losing other heroes. Basically Argent Adept is amazing.</p>",
