      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/f05b48/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-25T13:02:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I actually used to think that the Adept sucked. He needed too many things, too much set-up, and one Devastating Aurora later and he's another baby crying for mommy.</p><p>Keyword there is 'used to'.</p><p>I have to agree. Played correctly, with a competent player, AA is crazy. Unfortunately, one thing I was never able to mitigate about him is his turn length: my teammates would invariably get annoyed and impatient once my turn comes along.</p>",
