      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/a5b964/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-25T14:18:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>No, they activate in turn order. So if It was Argent, Legacy, Ex-Pat, and Golem, even incapped they go in that order. Also, if you have a card like the Pillars of Hercules that can only be gotten rid of if you skip a turn, incapped heroes count for that skipped turn. So if you just don't use Leacy's incapped power, bam, turn skipped.</p>",
