      "created_at": "2013-04-25T21:29:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I generally have not had a good experience with Double A and new players.&nbsp; He's great, don't get me wrong, but he isn't terribly friendly to new players when they're trying to learn the mechanics.&nbsp; I'd recommend sticking with the core game, and being <em>very</em> trigger-shy with Zero.</p>",
